original task query.
Meanwhile, directly generated pseudo skills might con-
tain hallucinated or unverified execution guidelines, making
them unreliable for direct use in practice as verified in our ex-
periments. Therefore, rather than treating them as executable


skills, we use each pseudo skill as a retrieval proxy to iden-
tify gallery skills with similar capabilities. Accordingly, we
