i .
(14)
By default, we set α = 2, β = 1, and γ = 1 for all em-
bedding backbones. For SkillRet-Embedding-0.6B and R3-
Embedding on the SkillRet benchmark, we use a different
weighting scheme with α = 4, β = 1, and γ = 0.25.
